cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its figures, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "QSOL_CQED: Wigner-function dynamics and atom-field entanglement in the Jaynes-Cummings model"
authors:
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Nguyen Khoi
    affiliation: "Boston University"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-16
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/alanknguyen/QSOL_CQED"
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX   <- fill in after the first Zenodo release
keywords:
  - Jaynes-Cummings model
  - cavity QED
  - Wigner function
  - Schrodinger cat state
  - entanglement entropy
  - logarithmic negativity
  - QuTiP
abstract: >-
  QuTiP simulations of the resonant Jaynes-Cummings model: Wigner-function
  dynamics and cat-state formation at half the revival time, atom-field
  entanglement (reduced entropy and logarithmic negativity) for coherent,
  thermal, squeezed and Fock initial fields, decoherence under cavity loss,
  a cat-state survival phase diagram, and photon-blockade statistics.
  Every figure of the accompanying manuscript is generated by the scripts
  in simulations/.
